"      <figure style=\"grid-column:1/-1\"><img src=\"img/notch-headphones.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"681\" height=\"232\" style=\"max-width:681px;margin:0 auto\"><figcaption><b>Al conectar tus AirPods o Beats</b>Como en el iPhone: el notch se despliega un momento con el modelo y la batería de cada pieza, y se pliega solo. Sin pedir ningún permiso.</figcaption></figure>": "      <figure style=\"grid-column:1/-1\"><img src=\"../img/en/notch-headphones.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"681\" height=\"232\" style=\"max-width:681px;margin:0 auto\"><figcaption><b>When your AirPods or Beats connect</b>Just like on iPhone: the notch expands for a moment with the model and each piece's battery, then folds away by itself. No permissions asked.</figcaption></figure>",
"      <p class=\"eyebrow\">Rendimiento</p>": "      <p class=\"eyebrow\">Performance</p>",
"      <h2>Ligera de verdad.</h2>": "      <h2>Genuinely light.</h2>",
"      <p class=\"lead\">Medimos OmniMac y las cinco apps a las que sustituye con el mismo método: cada una sola, en reposo, en el mismo Mac. Estos son los datos.</p>": "      <p class=\"lead\">We measured OmniMac and the five apps it replaces with the same method: each one alone, at idle, on the same Mac. Here is the data.</p>",
"        <h3>Memoria en reposo (RSS)</h3>": "        <h3>Memory at idle (RSS)</h3>",
"        <p>Menos es mejor · MB</p>": "        <p>Lower is better · MB</p>",
"<div class=\"bar-row sum\"><span class=\"lbl\">Las 5 juntas</span><span class=\"trk\"><i style=\"width:100%\"></i></span><span class=\"val\">636 MB</span></div></div>": "<div class=\"bar-row sum\"><span class=\"lbl\">All 5 together</span><span class=\"trk\"><i style=\"width:100%\"></i></span><span class=\"val\">636 MB</span></div></div>",
"        <h3>CPU en reposo</h3>": "        <h3>CPU at idle</h3>",
"        <p>Menos es mejor · % de un núcleo</p>": "        <p>Lower is better · % of one core</p>",
"<div class=\"bar-row sum\"><span class=\"lbl\">Las 5 juntas</span><span class=\"trk\"><i style=\"width:100%\"></i></span><span class=\"val\">0,420 %</span></div></div>": "<div class=\"bar-row sum\"><span class=\"lbl\">All 5 together</span><span class=\"trk\"><i style=\"width:100%\"></i></span><span class=\"val\">0,420 %</span></div></div>",
"    <p class=\"big center reveal\">Las cinco apps juntas ocupan 636 MB.<br>OmniMac las sustituye con <em>119 MB</em>: un 81 % menos.</p>": "    <p class=\"big center reveal\">The five apps together take 636 MB.<br>OmniMac replaces them with <em>119 MB</em>: 81 % less.</p>",
"    <p class=\"note reveal\">Medido el 4 de septiembre de 2026 en un MacBook con Apple silicon y macOS 26.5. CPU = tiempo de CPU consumido dividido por el tiempo transcurrido durante 60 s de reposo con el cursor lejos del notch; memoria = RSS (<code style=\"background:#2c2c2e;color:#fff\">ps -o rss</code>), BoringNotch incluye su proceso ayudante. La memoria física real de OmniMac (lo que enseña Monitor de Actividad) es de 50 MB; el resto son páginas compartidas de frameworks del sistema. Versiones: Amphetamine 5.3.2, AltTab 11.5.0, Rectangle 1.100, Maccy 2.7.1, BoringNotch 2.7.3, OmniMac 0.3.0 (medición). Un solo equipo y una sola tanda: son órdenes de magnitud, no décimas. Metodología completa en <code style=\"background:#2c2c2e;color:#fff\">docs/PERFORMANCE.md</code>.</p>": "    <p class=\"note reveal\">Measured on 4 September 2026 on an Apple silicon MacBook running macOS 26.5. CPU = CPU time consumed divided by elapsed time over 60 s at idle with the cursor away from the notch; memory = RSS (<code style=\"background:#2c2c2e;color:#fff\">ps -o rss</code>), BoringNotch includes its helper process. OmniMac's real physical memory (what Activity Monitor shows) is 50 MB; the rest is shared system-framework pages. Versions: Amphetamine 5.3.2, AltTab 11.5.0, Rectangle 1.100, Maccy 2.7.1, BoringNotch 2.7.3, OmniMac 0.3.0 (measurement). One machine and one run: think orders of magnitude, not decimals. Full methodology in <code style=\"background:#2c2c2e;color:#fff\">docs/PERFORMANCE.md</code>.</p>",
"      <p class=\"eyebrow\">Comparativa</p>": "      <p class=\"eyebrow\">Comparison</p>",
"      <h2>Una app en vez de cinco.</h2>": "      <h2>One app instead of five.</h2>",
"      <p class=\"lead\">Lo que hace cada una, según su documentación oficial y sus paneles de ajustes. Todas son buenas en lo suyo; la diferencia es hacerlo todo con una sola app residente.</p>": "      <p class=\"lead\">What each one does, according to its official documentation and settings panels. They are all good at their job; the difference is doing it all with a single resident app.</p>",
"          <tr><th>Función</th><th class=\"me\">OmniMac</th><th>Amphetamine</th><th>AltTab</th><th>Rectangle</th><th>Maccy</th><th>BoringNotch</th></tr>": "          <tr><th>Feature</th><th class=\"me\">OmniMac</th><th>Amphetamine</th><th>AltTab</th><th>Rectangle</th><th>Maccy</th><th>BoringNotch</th></tr>",
